      "value": "@{627e94e69bf04e1ede28a21b|full_name}: All I have done was I installed the beta, joined a instance full of people who are in Open Beta and It just started placing people's voices in random places (Audio has flipped. Left is Right and Right is left.). That's all I did. World audio does not seem to be affected by this just only people's voices.",
